<title>UK: SOCCER-ENGLISH LEAGUE AND CUP RESULTS.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-ENGLISH LEAGUE AND CUP RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results of English league and</p>
<p>cup soccer matches on Wednesday:</p>
<p>League Cup semifinal, second leg</p>
<p> Middlesbrough	   0  Stockport     1</p>
<p>(Middlesbrough win 2-1 on aggregate and meet</p>
<p>Leicester in the final on April 6 at Wembley)</p>
<p>Premier league</p>
<p> Leeds		     0  Southampton   0</p>
<p> Sheffield Wednesday   2  Sunderland    1</p>
<p> West Ham		  3  Chelsea	 2</p>
<p>Division one</p>
<p> Queen's Park Rangers  0  Reading	 2</p>
<p>Division two</p>
<p> Wrexham		   2  Luton	   1</p>
</text>
